        "text": "Crypto is life changing. I found out about crypto two years ago through a friend on her social media. I was working a 9 to 5. I wasn't fulfilled at all. Always stressed. I wanted to make a difference. My friend sent me a link about the Binance Charity tech scholarship. I was like, okay, what are the odds? So December they sent me an email that I had gotten the scholarship. I was excited. Wow. I didn't pay a dime for that course. I had the opportunity to study for nine months before I finished the course. I saw a job at a fintech in Africa and I got the job too. In just nine months, Crypto has changed my life, my career, that of my family has taken me from the grass to the graves. Ra.",
